# Signing key material. The P12 holds a private key and must never be committed;
# production loads it from AWS Secrets Manager or uses the gcloud-hsm transport.
apps/remix/signing/*.p12

# Session handover notes, written by the /quit skill. Working state about how a
# session went, not about the fork, and rewritten wholesale each time. Durable
# knowledge belongs in ARCHITECTURE.md instead, where it survives the next
# session overwriting this file. Kept out of the tree because every file we
# track is one more thing to reconcile when upstream is merged.
HANDOVER.md
